"refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "156060352", "author": {"steamid": "76561198024981477", "personaname": "Tre", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/trespeak/", "num_games_owned": 275, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 2910, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1039, "last_played": 1788928137, "avatar": "b7670d23e1a959a869246e649d787ad20c2ac127"}, "language": "english", "review": "watching this game grow and evolve over its development has been an absolute joy. it went from being my lil hidden gem to being a sleeper hit in the roguelike space. can't wait to see what's next for it post-release (:", "timestamp_created": 1705354726, "timestamp_updated": 1705354726, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "156060085", "author": {"steamid": "76561198086744839", "personaname": "udacznik", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198086744839/", "num_games_owned": 99, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 268, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 268, "last_played": 1705282480, "avatar": "fc8493c2493a55ecbfbe0ea8fb32f6f01f4eb68e"}, "language": "english", "review": "I don't know if you'll find this useful since it's from coop perspective. \nLet's make it short, If you're planning to buy this game to play coop with your friend the game would be pretty entertaining, but if you get a slight connnection problem (which happened at least 7 times to me and my friend) you'll get disconnected from the session with no way to get back to current run so you have to restart it. This happened often during loading screens to the next locations and since this issue happened to us after 2 hours of gameplay (we got easily to next levels in our runs after that time) we can't refund the game. The game is unplayable on multi because of that. Also starting all over with same weapons is felt pretty boring and frustrating since it wasn't our fault that we \"failed\" a run.", "timestamp_created": 1705354395, "timestamp_updated": 1705354395, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "156059842", "author": {"steamid": "76561198097681019", "personaname": "Seraphim", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/msaroufim/", "num_games_owned": 1095, "num_reviews": 63, "playtime_forever": 298, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 267, "last_played": 1705365694, "avatar": "d565d742cd3a909018ed63de5605ebfb4f28b709"}, "language": "english", "review": "nice", "timestamp_created": 1705354083, "timestamp_updated": 1705354083, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "156059102", "author": {"steamid": "76561199030781969", "personaname": "Rosethorn", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199030781969/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 23, "playtime_forever": 775, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 249, "last_played": 1732728900, "avatar": "11bde6f36a6ab7c01ed2e729fa3d7edc53669e14"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very