chase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "156058049", "author": {"steamid": "76561198060786781", "personaname": "Hellen Jelqer", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198060786781/", "num_games_owned": 326, "num_reviews": 87, "playtime_forever": 231, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 110, "last_played": 1705511675, "avatar": "bb06bf177952f63efa42cf058774f416930fd302"}, "language": "english", "review": "Not for low skill noobs, give it a try but I will not be recommending it to my low tier gamer buddies!!!", "timestamp_created": 1705352091, "timestamp_updated": 1705352091, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "156056992", "author": {"steamid": "76561198011972756", "personaname": "Past", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ShadowthePast/", "num_games_owned": 593, "num_reviews": 75, "playtime_forever": 1845, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1329, "last_played": 1706139336, "avatar": "0d10577d9b46aa10b6b03cfef419aec1eeb33520"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very fun. Environments are beautiful, varied and recognizable, with secrets to encourage exploring. Guns feel great and varied, and you're encouraged to constantly be swapping them. Nice sense of progression.\n\nI will say the bosses do get a bit ridiculous. I'm playing on Hard (hardest difficulty) so take that into account. Starting off it's just circling some idiot robot who will never hit you. Then suddenly it's like, oh the floor is lava and the boss is on a giant looping rail and laying mines on the rail so you have to dodge the mines + lasers while also shooting the boss. Or it's a giant brawler guy who runs up to you to try and punch you, then IMMEDIATELY after missing a punch, launches a stun grenade in your face, followed up by punching you again and nuking half your health bar. Or it's a big guy on a giant wall rail climbing up a tower while the floor is rising lava, so you have to climb the tower with it while also dodging fire. And if you don't kill him fast enough then you only get a tiny tiny platform to work with. Good luck doing that one without any of the jump/jetpack upgrades.\n\nOverall, it's fun, but can be slightly frustrating to consistently lose to the final boss because it's just not practical to dodge all the crap it throws at you.\n\nEdit: Oh yeah, there's currently not any way to save your current run. So if your game crashes or you need to exit the game mid-run, back to the start for you. But they're supposedly working on it. Just note that I've had about 6-7 crashes in my ~20 hours of playtime.", "timestamp_created": 1705350913, "timestamp_updated": 1705374583, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "156056986", "author": {"steamid": "76561198932745719", "personaname": "Slayer", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/734534567578685/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 33, "playtime_forever": 2474, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 789, "last_played": 1737674925, "avatar": "9c383c08af7faaa44aa5c7a3ad2279d14488b9fd"}, "language": "english", "review": "one of the best rouguelikes ive played for a long time the very few issues i have more or less come down with communication with developers and a want for more content", "timestamp_created": 1705350908, "timestamp_updated": 1705350908, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "156056437", "author": {"steamid": "76561198053692984", "personaname": "[Dra'nakyuek] Spellmyname", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198053692984/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 23, "playtime_forever": 2890, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1824, "last_played": 1705929812, "avatar": "1a6a946be04b03a5f9373ec1e9f6cf8e07d6c7cd"}, "language": "english", "review": "Simply said it´s one of if not the best FPS rouge like out there.\nGot it back in EA and came back to 1.0 a couple of days ago and it´s just a shining star in the sky of indie games. \nGameplay is top notch, classes all feel very different, same with weapons.\nLoads of secrets that reward exploration.\nRuns on my old machine (4770K and 980Ti) like butter on 60FPS 1980x1080.\nThe OST is soooooooooooooooooooooo ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ dope, like legit worth the buy just for that.\n\nSo stfu, get the game and blast some robot ass.", "timestamp_created": 1705350319, "timestamp_updated": 1705498188, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "156052356", "author": {"steamid": "76561199271226950", "personaname": "BravoKilo777", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199271226950/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 15, "play